    },
    {
      "name": "Brand Showcase Card",
      "role": "Horizontal carousel of case-study thumbnails (New Balance, GoPro, Squarespace, Nissan)",
      "description": "Full-bleed photographic card (no border, 0 radius, no shadow) with the brand logo overlaid in white at 40–48px, positioned ~20% from the top. Below the card: Inter 18px medium brand name in black, followed by 14px regular Slate subtext ('\"Track title\" by Artist'). Carousel arrows (← →) in a 40px square bone-filled button with black chevron."
